@startuml
autonumber
actor "Cliente" as User
participant "API (Main Thread)" as Main
participant "Worker Thread (IA)" as WorkerIA
participant "Worker Thread (Segurança)" as WorkerSec
database "Banco de Dados" as DB

User -> Main: POST /analisar-video (Upload Vídeo)
activate Main

Main -> Main: Validar arquivo e gerar Job_ID
Main -> WorkerIA: Despachar tarefa de inferência (Assíncrono)
activate WorkerIA

Main --> User: 202 Accepted (Job_ID retornado)
deactivate Main

note over WorkerIA: Processamento em paralelo\nsem bloquear a API principal
WorkerIA -> WorkerIA: Extrair frames e classificar linha do tempo
WorkerIA -> WorkerSec: Enviar dados brutos para pipeline seguro
deactivate WorkerIA
activate WorkerSec

WorkerSec -> WorkerSec: Aplicar Ofuscação MCE
WorkerSec -> WorkerSec: Cifrar via AES-256-GCM
WorkerSec -> DB: Salvar payload cifrado (Job_ID = concluído)
activate DB
DB --> WorkerSec: Confirmação de persistência
deactivate DB
deactivate WorkerSec

... Polling do Cliente ...

User -> Main: GET /jobs/{Job_ID}/resultado
activate Main
Main -> DB: Buscar registro por Job_ID
activate DB
DB --> Main: Payload Cifrado
deactivate DB

Main -> WorkerSec: Solicitar Decifragem e Restauração MCE
activate WorkerSec
WorkerSec --> Main: Dados Legíveis Restaurados
deactivate WorkerSec

Main --> User: 200 OK (Relatório Completo)
deactivate Main
@enduml